<title>NETHERLANDS: RABO SECURITIES SEES SAMAS/SAMNC.AS/ AS A BUY.</title>
<headline>RABO SECURITIES SEES SAMAS/SAMNC.AS/ AS A BUY.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of January research.</p>
<p>Company------Sector-------------------Broker----------------</p>
<p>Samas	  office equipment	   Rabo Securities</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy</p>
<p>Samas has improved market strength in past years and will</p>
<p>focus entirely on improving results in next two years. Cost</p>
<p>savings can be realised in production and costs can be cut by 10</p>
<p>percent in next two years with adequate reorganisation</p>
<p>provisions already made in 1995. Price target for end 1997 is</p>
<p>100 guilders.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS     Dividend</p>
<p>    1996/97		6.00    2.10</p>
<p>    1997/98		7.50    2.65</p>
<p>    1998/99	     10.00    3.50</p>
<p>    1999/2000	    9.62    3.37</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
